     "2813e98c-ba99-4600-b09a-3da6d13ea488"], Cell["\<\
Playfair's axiom: exactly one parallel through a point off the line.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"792b8e09-120a-4a14-bbd2-a4c74a244953"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f8ab0bbb-c865-43b0-8660-061776fb93fc"], Cell[
